      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "PAW NIALL (2) was sent out long odds last time but charged out of the boxes with a strong early sectional and went on to clock 29.72 in a half a length win at Sandown over 515m. Yet to win out of this box but has been in the placings five times from nine starts. Expected to be right there at the finish again. LITTLE BONT (8) was out of the placings latest but three back was a Grade 5 winner in quick time (27.67) at this track in a Grade 5. Can feature with the right run. PAW MANNY (1) did a good job to finish second last time out over 450m at Shepparton (25.57) in a Special conditions Veteran race, the second top-three finish on the trot. Can improve sharply here. SLICK BADGER (3) is a last start winner who can measure up again.",
